---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" path="/404/" title="404 — Pedro Bengoa" description="Page not found." noindex>
  <section class="container-page grid gap-12 py-24 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">HTTP 404</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">This page doesn’t exist.</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
        I’ve migrated a lot of things in my career, and apparently this URL didn’t make the cut. No rollback plan for this one.
      </p>
      <a class="link mt-6 inline-block" href="/">← Back to home</a>
    </div>
    <div lang="es">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">HTTP 404</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Esta página no existe.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
        Migré muchas cosas en mi carrera, y parece que esta URL no llegó. Para esta no hay plan de rollback.
      </p>
      <a class="link mt-6 inline-block" href="/es/">← Volver al inicio</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
